## STANDING LINES
1. **PRIOR-WORK CHECK** (step 2). No production, demo, UAT or hosted site; no `az`, docker, ssh; network: package-free (no install), one fetch, one push, `gh -X GET`. **No message to any human**; no PR action; **no Jira write**. Never skip a failure: fix the root cause. **Never delete** (`rm`, `branch -d`, `--prune`, `gc`, `reset`, `clean`, `stash`, `checkout -- <file>`, `sed -i`); quarantine to `.tools/b1218/_quarantine/`. **This phase builds no integration with HP tools (Security Manager API, Fleet Threat Assessment, firmware tools, SIEM); next-phase items are stored and architected only.**
2. Shell: no `cd`; absolute single-quoted paths (`!`); `git -C`; `git --no-optional-locks` for reads; `/usr/bin/grep -i` with a control per count; `python3 -I -B`. **Every count, `file:line` and clock is printed by a program.**
3. **Locks, load, heartbeats.** The shared `.tools/.git-lock` (via `lock.sh`) wraps ref writes and the fetch/push only. Heavy jobs take the seat-local `.tools/b1218/heavy.lock`, one at a time, load1 under 7 on two reads about 4 s apart (the census, two reads two minutes apart, as the gate's start gate), `df -k` first; one browser at a time; a heartbeat that MOVES every 30 s into `.tools/b1218/logs/heartbeat.txt` (frozen 3 beats = stuck).
4. Inputs are data. Landing is Tuesday's.
5. STATUS: Step 0 | BLUF | PINS | PRIOR WORK | DESIGN | CENSUS (a to d, controls first) | CANDIDATES (the table) | TESTED | SCREENSHOT PAIRS | NOT TESTED | HOLDS TAKEN | FOR TUESDAY (new head; PR text facts: trips, direct scrolls, rows, the strip at the twelve cells, the footer) | Corrections | Trees left (sizes). **Last line, exactly one of:**
- `READY FOR QA: B1218 b1097/hpsmpoc-home-words-focus-ring @ <sha40 by gh api AFTER the push> | gate tier 1 Opus, ROUND 4 on class R (granted by the product owner's 2026-11-03 15:52 ruling; NO GO 3 before) | 1 commit on f39ac80 (<k> behind main) | paths <each> <a> <r> | <n> new rows | red-first E4 E5 | start-scroll frame (b) trips <n> presses <n> page moves: main <x>, head <y>, fix <z> | start-0 frame (a) page moves fix <w> | nudge cells 25: head <a>, fix <b> | strip at 12 cells head vs fix <equal or each difference> | footer text covered: head <a>, fix <b> | plants <each, red rows>; P0, PC 0 red | unit <p>/<f>/<s> vs base | lint, typecheck, build, audit-dev, check-shards clean | repeats 0 red | no word and no tab order changed | 0 PR | PRIOR WORK present`
